        },
        {
          "text": "$\\dfrac1{\\cos x}$",
          "why": "This is the reciprocal cosine function, secant, not cotangent."
        },
        {
          "text": "$\\dfrac1{\\tan x}$",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "text": "$\\cos^{-1}x$",
          "why": "This denotes inverse cosine rather than the reciprocal of tangent."
        }
      ],
      "solution_text": "On the common domain where $\\sin x\\ne0$ and $\\cos x\\ne0$, $\\cot x=\\dfrac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}=\\dfrac1{\\tan x}$."
